    "name": "Veil of Torment",
    "steam_appid": 3832300,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>Veil of Torment</i>, you step into the shoes of Jake, a determined man searching for a missing girl last seen near the infamous <strong>Black Water Asylum</strong> \u2014 a place long abandoned, sealed off, and buried in mystery.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What begins as a rescue mission quickly spirals into a living nightmare. As you explore the decaying asylum grounds, you'll uncover twisted experiments, cryptic notes, and hostile presences lurking in the dark. The deeper you go, the more you question your sanity \u2014 and the horrifying truth behind the girl's disappearance.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you bring her back... or become another lost soul in the asylum's grip?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong><br>Dive into a haunting narrative that blends supernatural terror with human tragedy and madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Investigation</strong><br>Search for clues, documents, and key evidence that reveal the girl\u2019s fate and the asylum\u2019s hidden past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong><br>Explore immersive, handcrafted environments like asylum, decrepit wine cellar, haunted graveyard, and cursed chapel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective-Based Progression</strong><br>Solve environmental puzzles, unlock sealed areas, and survive as you progress through major story objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Presentation</strong><br>Tense sound design, dynamic lighting, and detailed visuals immerse you fully in the horror experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <i>Veil of Torment</i>, you step into the shoes of Jake, a determined man searching for a missing girl last seen near the infamous <strong>Black Water Asylum</strong> \u2014 a place long abandoned, sealed off, and buried in mystery.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What begins as a rescue mission quickly spirals into a living nightmare. As you explore the decaying asylum grounds, you'll uncover twisted experiments, cryptic notes, and hostile presences lurking in the dark. The deeper you go, the more you question your sanity \u2014 and the horrifying truth behind the girl's disappearance.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you bring her back... or become another lost soul in the asylum's grip?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror</strong><br>Dive into a haunting narrative that blends supernatural terror with human tragedy and madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Investigation</strong><br>Search for clues, documents, and key evidence that reveal the girl\u2019s fate and the asylum\u2019s hidden past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Atmospheric Exploration</strong><br>Explore immersive, handcrafted environments like asylum, decrepit wine cellar, haunted graveyard, and cursed chapel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Objective-Based Progression</strong><br>Solve environmental puzzles, unlock sealed areas, and survive as you progress through major story objectives.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cinematic Presentation</strong><br>Tense sound design, dynamic lighting, and detailed visuals immerse you fully in the horror experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Enter the abandoned Black Water Asylum in search of a missing girl. Veil of Torment is a psychological horror game where reality twists, shadows whisper, and every step drags you deeper into madness.",
